The aws-secrets-agent/ directory does NOT vendor that source. Its Dockerfile
fetches the upstream agent at a pinned commit SHA at build time and applies the
two patches under aws-secrets-agent/patches/ (bind 0.0.0.0; drop the TTL hop
limit) so the sidecar is reachable across a container network. See
aws-secrets-agent/patches/README.md for details and how to bump the pin.
